## Extra Challenge (Highly Recommended)

After completing each project:

1. Delete **everything** in AWS.
2. Wait 10 minutes.
3. Rebuild the entire project from memory.
4. Compare your rebuilt version with your documentation.
5. Update the documentation with anything you forgot or improved.

That repetition will strengthen your troubleshooting skills, reduce reliance on tutorials, and give you the confidence to build similar environments in interviews or on the job.

